Package: labtower
Version: 2.1m
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), nginx, nut, nut-client, snmp, sudo, iputils-ping
Recommends: openssh-client, gnupg, openssl, cron | cron-daemon
Suggests: ieee-data, librespeed-cli
Conflicts: pi-console
Replaces: pi-console
Maintainer: Gonzalo Valenzuela <gonzalo@rave.cl>
Description: LabTower — Homelab dashboard
 Self-hosted homelab dashboard for Raspberry Pi with modules:
 WOL Console, UPS Monitor, Net Monitor, Proxmox Monitor, NAS Monitor,
 Overview and Admin Panel.
 Served via nginx reverse proxy with shared SSO authentication.
 Author: Gonzalo Valenzuela <gonzalo@rave.cl>
